833
01:08:13.741 --> 01:08:14.916
- Right, right, 'cause
we're gonna kill the elephant.

834
01:08:15.091 --> 01:08:17.049
- Well, I am.
- Well, yeah, yeah.

835
01:08:17.223 --> 01:08:19.356
Hey, can I have one?
- Yeah.

836
01:08:19.530 --> 01:08:22.837
Worm, worm, here.
