867
01:12:24.688 --> 01:12:25.950
- Okay.

868
01:12:26.124 --> 01:12:26.951
Okay.

869
01:12:30.041 --> 01:12:31.085
Okay, Flora.

870
01:12:33.218 --> 01:12:35.786
Hey, I can't Dawn
