I don't have a dad.

899
01:15:45.410 --> 01:15:47.064
So don't lose yours.

900
01:16:03.733 --> 01:16:04.734
- Woo!

901
01:16:06.953 --> 01:16:07.911
- We made it!

902
01:16:09.521 --> 01:16:10.478
Woo-hoo-hoo!

903
01:16:10.653 --> 01:16:12.219
