904
01:16:12.393 --> 01:16:13.264
Woo!

905
01:16:14.787 --> 01:16:16.310
Woo-hoo-hoo!

906
01:16:43.947 --> 01:16:46.514
- My leg's starting to ache,
you know what that means right?

907
01:16:46.689 --> 01:16:48.560
- We get to kill the elephant.
