- Noisy.
- Alright, you get up there.

930
01:18:29.182 --> 01:18:32.490
I'll get you some rope.
- Wait, wait, up there?

931
01:18:32.664 --> 01:18:33.839
- Are you kidding?

932
01:18:34.013 --> 01:18:35.580
I have to do everything?

933
01:18:46.678 --> 01:18:48.419
