1001
01:25:04.577 --> 01:25:06.840
- Yeah, that's your job,
but I could be a clown.

1002
01:25:07.014 --> 01:25:09.800
- Yeah, he's not
funny.

1003
01:25:09.974 --> 01:25:11.628
- I'll start as a candy butcher.

1004
01:25:11.802 --> 01:25:13.804
