the cotton candy machine.

1005
01:25:14.935 --> 01:25:17.503
See?

1006
01:25:19.897 --> 01:25:20.724
Flora.

1007
01:25:52.190 --> 01:25:54.366
You've made a new
friend already?

1008
01:25:54.540 --> 01:25:55.715
