1035
01:28:51.500 --> 01:28:56.200
♪ I wanna taste it ♪

1036
01:28:56.374 --> 01:29:00.857
♪ Faithfully I'll
give you all of me ♪

1037
01:29:01.031 --> 01:29:04.121
♪ I'll give you the best of me ♪

1038
01:29:04.295 --> 01:29:08.908
♪ I'll give it everything ♪

1039
01:29:09.082 --> 01:29:12.259
♪ And I go run up to
